00:10:20.554 --> 00:10:22.444
Because one's gonna have to give.

00:10:24.428 --> 00:10:26.773
I'm trying to walk the tightrope, and boy,

00:10:26.773 --> 00:10:29.681
I think I'm really doing a solid job.

00:10:29.691 --> 00:10:33.610
But I'm not sure, the
question I don't have answered

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.978
