00:10:56.131 --> 00:10:59.055
The regrets, can I minimize the regrets.

00:10:59.055 --> 00:11:02.252
Because I think having regret is the most

00:11:02.252 --> 00:11:03.461
unfortunate thing.

00:11:03.461 --> 00:11:06.807
Meeting a 70, 80, 90,
100 year old who regrets.

00:11:06.807 --> 00:11:09.200
Regrets that they didn't have more fun.

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.371
Didn't spend more time with their family.

00:11:11.371 --> 00:11:12.334
That's the cliche one.

00:11:12.334 --> 00:11:13.878
But you'd be surprised how many people

00:11:13.878 --> 00:11:15.574
regret not doing more for themselves.

00:11:16.812 --> 00:11:17.787
So I don't know.

00:11:19.525 --> 00:11:20.611
It's kind of intense.

00:11:21.397 --> 00:11:22.582
That was quite real.

00:11:22.582 --> 00:11:24.280
That was really real.

00:11:25.627 --> 00:11:27.426
(mumbling)

