The engagement, monetizing them,

00:12:16.975 --> 00:12:18.899
drop some knowledge on me.

00:12:18.899 --> 00:12:21.360
- (laughs) First of all,
the best part about Rob,

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:24.112
