00:12:35.724 --> 00:12:37.277
I think Twitter polls really work.

00:12:37.277 --> 00:12:38.967
I've been getting a lot of engagement,

00:12:38.967 --> 00:12:40.766
two or three that I've tested.

00:12:40.766 --> 00:12:42.546
It's very simple.
Humans are basic.

00:12:42.546 --> 00:12:44.211
