00:12:50.701 --> 00:12:52.831
Twitter will monetize them,
it's on their platform.

00:12:53.513 --> 00:12:55.383
More engagement, they'll
run into their metrics

00:12:55.383 --> 00:12:57.957
for you, for me, for
others, for all of us,

00:12:57.957 --> 00:12:59.879
tt's an opportunity to engage our audience

00:12:59.879 --> 00:13:02.098
on Twitter a little bit more often.

00:13:02.098 --> 00:13:03.646
I think if you really get good at it,

00:13:03.646 --> 00:13:05.562
you get clever with questions,

00:13:05.562 --> 00:13:11.143
or win in a long tail niche, 
there's some real opportunities.

00:13:14.226 --> 00:13:18.395
So I think that, I think that.

00:13:20.539 --> 00:13:23.110
I think that a very smart
Twitter poll strategy

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:26.007
