the pollster on the platform

00:13:33.997 --> 00:13:35.796
is the only extreme upside.

00:13:35.796 --> 00:13:38.329
For everybody else, it's a nice tactic.

00:13:38.329 --> 00:13:39.674
So for four to five people in the world,

00:13:39.674 --> 00:13:43.659
