00:13:54.017 --> 00:13:55.137
people seeing your tweets,

00:13:55.137 --> 00:13:57.227
everybody seeing all of your content.

00:13:57.227 --> 00:14:00.540
Maybe you win on less about 
how many people will see it.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.645
But people pay more attention to you

00:14:01.645 --> 00:14:03.876
because your polls made
you interesting to them,

00:14:03.876 --> 00:14:05.560
and now they're looking
at all your content.

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:10.201
So I think it's a very long
tail value prop for people.

